<!doctype lake><meta name="doc-version" content="1" /><meta name="viewport" content="fixed" /><meta name="typography" content="classic" /><meta name="paragraphSpacing" content="relax" /><h2 data-lake-id="pMBaq" id="pMBaq"><span data-lake-id="u3dd7a0c3" id="u3dd7a0c3">功能描述</span></h2><p data-lake-id="u12e26afc" id="u12e26afc"><span data-lake-id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-1-0" id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-1-0">支持整数，浮点，LR/SC，AMO和AMOCAS等原子访存，支持缓存一致性，miss合并，非阻塞，replay，指令预取和CMO的4 way组相联，256set，大小为64KB的数据Cache。</span></p><p data-lake-id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-2" id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-2"><span data-lake-id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-2-0" id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-2-0">暂不支持硬件预取，ECC检查，ECC注入。</span></p><p data-lake-id="u30c24a70" id="u30c24a70"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F35409901%2F1793084945603-e8e43ce2-abf9-48a7-bd4e-f803cbb7530e.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u083a9e98-3314-4fbc-8907-3e8c6473f12%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u47c96fb2-f01f-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A661.8181818181819%2C%22height%22%3A329%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A49136%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A910%2C%22originHeight%22%3A453%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.375%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22ETAARRAYDATAARRAY%22%2C%22x%22%3A356%2C%22y%22%3A177%2C%22width%22%3A120%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TOMICLNITEEE%22%2C%22x%22%3A44%2C%22y%22%3A330%2C%22width%22%3A96%2C%22height%22%3A9%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%85%88%3ASNPRPPCOMP%22%2C%22x%22%3A629%2C%22y%22%3A184%2C%22width%22%3A76%2C%22height%22%3A8%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22STOREBUFFER%22%2C%22x%22%3A37%2C%22y%22%3A235%2C%22width%22%3A69%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SSDERTERECIACEE%22%2C%22x%22%3A285%2C%22y%22%3A206%2C%22width%22%3A67%2C%22height%22%3A10%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TAGARAYM%22%2C%22x%22%3A289%2C%22y%22%3A178%2C%22width%22%3A69%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SNOODQUEUE%22%2C%22x%22%3A544%2C%22y%22%3A364%2C%22width%22%3A77%2C%22height%22%3A10%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22COMPACT-CHI%22%2C%22x%22%3A774%2C%22y%22%3A222%2C%22width%22%3A70%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22WRITEBAC%22%2C%22x%22%3A553%2C%22y%22%3A229%2C%22width%22%3A46%2C%22height%22%3A11%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22MAINPIPE%22%2C%22x%22%3A356%2C%22y%22%3A254%2C%22width%22%3A54%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22MISSQUEUE%22%2C%22x%22%3A545%2C%22y%22%3A84%2C%22width%22%3A61%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22L2CACHE%22%2C%22x%22%3A778%2C%22y%22%3A209%2C%22width%22%3A66%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22OADQUEUE%22%2C%22x%22%3A41%2C%22y%22%3A92%2C%22width%22%3A69%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%222700E%22%2C%22x%22%3A465%2C%22y%22%3A267%2C%22width%22%3A34%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LOADPIPE%22%2C%22x%22%3A283%2C%22y%22%3A127%2C%22width%22%3A45%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ATOMIEROG.%22%2C%22x%22%3A263%2C%22y%22%3A250%2C%22width%22%3A46%2C%22height%22%3A11%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22E%22%2C%22x%22%3A269%2C%22y%22%3A227%2C%22width%22%3A43%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2200-16%22%2C%22x%22%3A614%2C%22y%22%3A138%2C%22width%22%3A36%2C%22height%22%3A8%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22LOADPIPE%22%2C%22x%22%3A282%2C%22y%22%3A68%2C%22width%22%3A50%2C%22height%22%3A11%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22QUEUE%22%2C%22x%22%3A556%2C%22y%22%3A244%2C%22width%22%3A40%2C%22height%22%3A11%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22N..TOEEP%22%2C%22x%22%3A53%2C%22y%22%3A231%2C%22width%22%3A90%2C%22height%22%3A5%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TXRSP%22%2C%22x%22%3A644%2C%22y%22%3A170%2C%22width%22%3A52%2C%22height%22%3A11%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22RXRSP%22%2C%22x%22%3A642%2C%22y%22%3A144%2C%22width%22%3A44%2C%22height%22%3A10%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TXEVT%22%2C%22x%22%3A650%2C%22y%22%3A210%2C%22width%22%3A30%2C%22height%22%3A10%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TXREO%22%2C%22x%22%3A653%2C%22y%22%3A53%2C%22width%22%3A28%2C%22height%22%3A10%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22UEEAREP%22%2C%22x%22%3A83%2C%22y%22%3A95%2C%22width%22%3A69%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22RXDAT%22%2C%22x%22%3A663%2C%22y%22%3A93%2C%22width%22%3A32%2C%22height%22%3A9%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22BSRCPICAA%22%2C%22x%22%3A406%2C%22y%22%3A211%2C%22width%22%3A61%2C%22height%22%3A9%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22.E%22%2C%22x%22%3A245%2C%22y%22%3A61%2C%22width%22%3A31%2C%22height%22%3A11%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TXDAT%22%2C%22x%22%3A650%2C%22y%22%3A240%2C%22width%22%3A30%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23fbf9f8%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u9c0f55df%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ud179518c" id="ud179518c" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-4-0" id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-4-0">架构图以及事务分析</span></p><ul list="ub3fdf979"><li fid="ucfc81599" data-lake-id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-5" id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-5"><strong><span data-lake-id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-5-0" id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-5-0" class="lake-fontsize-11">LoadPipe</span></strong><span data-lake-id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-5-1" id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-5-1" class="lake-fontsize-11">：处理普通 load 的 tag、meta、data 访问，完成命中判断，并产生 miss、 replay 结果。</span></li><li fid="ucfc81599" data-lake-id="u5d31ba76" id="u5d31ba76"><strong><span data-lake-id="u043175ef" id="u043175ef" class="lake-fontsize-11">MainPipe</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u7a6aa6ea" id="u7a6aa6ea" class="lake-fontsize-11">：负责接收四路请求，在s0阶段进行仲裁，优先级：Snoop &gt; Refill &gt; Store&gt; Atomic，store只从Sbuffer中来，没有store pipe去提前预取。在Refill阶段的s1选中要被踢出的缓存行，s3把有效旧行交给WritebackQueue，同一拍写入新行。</span></li><li fid="ucfc81599" data-lake-id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-8" id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-8"><strong><span data-lake-id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-8-0" id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-8-0" class="lake-fontsize-11">MissQueue</span></strong><span data-lake-id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-8-1" id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-8-1" class="lake-fontsize-11">：实现 16项的MSHR，记录一个 cache line miss 的完整生命周期，负责 miss 合并or拒绝or申请、发TXREQ、收RXDAT和RXRSP，可以对Loadunit进行数据前递。等到一条cacheline的数据齐了，就向Mainpipe发refillreq。CMO请求从storebuffer进入DCache，最后进入MissQueue中的CMOUnit单元。CMO发的请求固定txnID为16.</span></li><li fid="ucfc81599" data-lake-id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-9" id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-9"><strong><span data-lake-id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-9-0" id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-9-0" class="lake-fontsize-11">ProbeQueue</span></strong><span data-lake-id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-9-1" id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-9-1" class="lake-fontsize-11">：只通过RXSNP接收L2来的发来的snoop请求，并把地址，snoop，txnID等作为probereq发送给Mainpipe。在Mainpipe的s0收下后下一排就可以释放。</span></li><li fid="ucfc81599" data-lake-id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-10" id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-10"><strong><span data-lake-id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-10-0" id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-10-0" class="lake-fontsize-11">WritebackQueue</span></strong><span data-lake-id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-10-1" id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-10-1" class="lake-fontsize-11">：WritebackQueue收到Mainpipe替换出来的旧行，如果需要传数据通过TXDAT通道传，如果不需要传数据，通过TXEVT通道传，通过TXRSP进行L2的Snoop回复。CMO clean/flush要写回的脏行也通过TXDAT通道传输。</span></li><li fid="ucfc81599" data-lake-id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-11" id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-11"><strong><span data-lake-id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-11-0" id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-11-0" class="lake-fontsize-11">CMO 单元</span></strong><span data-lake-id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-11-1" id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-11-1" class="lake-fontsize-11">：按 cache line 执行 </span><code data-lake-id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-11-2" id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-11-2"><span data-lake-id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-11-2-0" id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-11-2-0" class="lake-fontsize-11">clean</span></code><span data-lake-id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-11-3" id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-11-3" class="lake-fontsize-11">、</span><code data-lake-id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-11-4" id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-11-4"><span data-lake-id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-11-4-0" id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-11-4-0" class="lake-fontsize-11">flush</span></code><span data-lake-id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-11-5" id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-11-5" class="lake-fontsize-11">、</span><code data-lake-id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-11-6" id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-11-6"><span data-lake-id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-11-6-0" id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-11-6-0" class="lake-fontsize-11">inval</span></code><span data-lake-id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-11-7" id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-11-7" class="lake-fontsize-11"> 和 </span><code data-lake-id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-11-8" id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-11-8"><span data-lake-id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-11-8-0" id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-11-8-0" class="lake-fontsize-11">zero</span></code><span data-lake-id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-11-9" id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-11-9" class="lake-fontsize-11">，并将请求和普通访存正确排序。例化在MissQueue中，zero的CMO操作被处理为一条store 全0指令。</span></li></ul><h2 data-lake-id="fLspB" id="fLspB"><span data-lake-id="uf3e960b5" id="uf3e960b5">参数描述</span></h2><p data-lake-id="u3a61eb28" id="u3a61eb28"><span data-lake-id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-14-0" id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-14-0">可配置参数</span></p><table data-lake-id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-15-0" id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-15-0" margin="true" class="lake-table" style="width: 682px"><colgroup><col width="137"><col width="145"><col width="400"></colgroup><tbody><tr data-lake-id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-15-0-0" id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-15-0-0"><td data-lake-id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-15-0-0-0" id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-15-0-0-0" style="background-color: #fbe4e7"><p data-lake-id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-15-0-0-0-0" id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-15-0-0-0-0"><span data-lake-id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-15-0-0-0-0-0" id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-15-0-0-0-0-0" style="color: #70000d">参数</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-15-0-0-1" id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-15-0-0-1" style="background-color: #fbe4e7"><p data-lake-id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-15-0-0-1-0" id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-15-0-0-1-0"><span data-lake-id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-15-0-0-1-0-0" id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-15-0-0-1-0-0" style="color: #70000d">默认值</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-15-0-0-2" id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-15-0-0-2" style="background-color: #fbe4e7"><p data-lake-id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-15-0-0-2-0" id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-15-0-0-2-0"><span data-lake-id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-15-0-0-2-0-0" id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-15-0-0-2-0-0" style="color: #70000d">含义</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d