-17"><span data-lake-id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-17-0" id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-17-0">CPU侧DCache上游接口</span></h3><p data-lake-id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-18" id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-18"><span data-lake-id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-18-0" id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-18-0">见下级文件DCache上游接口</span></p><h3 data-lake-id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-19" id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-19"><span data-lake-id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-19-0" id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-19-0">下级缓存Compact CHI侧接口</span></h3><p data-lake-id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-20" id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-20"><span data-lake-id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-20-0" id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-20-0">见下级文件 DCache -&gt; L2接口 </span></p><h2 data-lake-id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-21" id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-21"><span data-lake-id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-21-0" id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-21-0">模块设计</span></h2><p data-lake-id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-22" id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-22"><span data-lake-id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-22-0" id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-22-0">见各下级文件</span></p><p data-lake-id="uc99b6f01" id="uc99b6f01"><span data-lake-id="u9373f0f0" id="u9373f0f0">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-23" id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-23"><strong><span data-lake-id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-23-0" id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-23-0">本次设计不带路预测</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u368a8e36" id="u368a8e36">。香山中的路预测仅仅只是做到降低功耗的作用，没办法做到将load-to-use提前几个时钟周期，同时如果预测错误的话会产生replay机制，我认为这个得不偿失。还有香山load的颗粒度不一样。</span></p><p data-lake-id="ubee05766" id="ubee05766"><strong><span data-lake-id="u3d341011" id="u3d341011">那香山为什么做呢？</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u02698374" id="u02698374">香山的串行loadpipe的WPU是可开关的，如果是开WPU的，那在s0访问tag和meta的时候能获得预测的way，然后s1阶段就直接拿这个way去访问data sram。与之不同的是，如果不开WPU，那在s0访问tag和meta的时候不能得到正确的那个way，因此在s1访问data sram的时候会把set中的所有way的值都取出，再判断miss or hit。因此可以看出开wpu与不开wpu的区别是访问data sram的数据宽度不同，这会导致功耗不同，同时data sram的组织形式也不一样。</span></p><p data-lake-id="uad8b22f3" id="uad8b22f3"><strong><span data-lake-id="ufb882b0d" id="ufb882b0d">​</span></strong><br></p><p data-lake-id="ueda8c5fc" id="ueda8c5fc"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F35409901%2F1793168948500-26f50665-7564-4a5d-9995-2abd53dbef17.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u1b37464e-e064-4946-9d5a-0acf579ecc9%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22udb9a2222-5978-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A477.6%2C%22height%22%3A355%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22%E9%A6%99%E5%B1%B1-%E4%B8%8D%E5%B8%A6wpu%E7%9A%84data%20bank%E7%BB%84%E7%BB%87%E5%BD%A2%E5%BC%8F.drawio.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A120178%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A597%2C%22originHeight%22%3A444%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22256SET%2C4WAY%2C8BANK%E7%9A%84DATABANK%E7%BB%84%E7%BB%87%E5%BD%A2%E5%BD%A2%E5%BC%8F%22%2C%22x%22%3A159%2C%22y%22%3A0%2C%22width%22%3A393%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E9%80%89SET%E4%B9%8B%E5%90%8E%E8%AF%BB%E8%A6%81%E6%8A%8A%E6%89%80%E6%9C%89%22%2C%22x%22%3A261%2C%22y%22%3A289%2C%22width%22%3A186%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22WAY%E9%83%BD%E8%AF%BB%E5%87%BA%E6%9D%A5%22%2C%22x%22%3A294%2C%22y%22%3A315%2C%22width%22%3A120%2C%22height%22%3A19%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E4%B8%8D%E5%B8%A6WPU%22%2C%22x%22%3A43%2C%22y%22%3A44%2C%22width%22%3A54%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SET255%22%2C%22x%22%3A13%2C%22y%22%3A384%2C%22width%22%3A42%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22OFFSET3%22%2C%22x%22%3A352%2C%22y%22%3A235%2C%22width%22%3A37%2C%22hei