ee3%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u0739df35" id="u0739df35" style="text-indent: 2em; padding-left: 6em"><span data-lake-id="u7d75f4ae" id="u7d75f4ae">带WPU的Bank组织形式如上</span></p><p data-lake-id="uee8949c0" id="uee8949c0"><br></p><h2 data-lake-id="Sluhm" id="Sluhm"><span data-lake-id="u2e346289" id="u2e346289">事务描述</span></h2><h4 data-lake-id="gBfQp" id="gBfQp"><span data-lake-id="ud0364ef9" id="ud0364ef9">Load事务</span></h4><p data-lake-id="u8d5484d7" id="u8d5484d7"><span data-lake-id="u7dfa52e6" id="u7dfa52e6" class="lake-fontsize-11">具体见LoadPipe。</span></p><p data-lake-id="u791eeefc" id="u791eeefc"><span data-lake-id="uf5667ba6" id="uf5667ba6">​</span><br></p><h4 data-lake-id="Ji6LV" id="Ji6LV"><span data-lake-id="u4094df59" id="u4094df59">Store事务</span></h4><p data-lake-id="ue0f937ca" id="ue0f937ca"><span data-lake-id="u08bab89d" id="u08bab89d" class="lake-fontsize-11">具体见MainPipe。</span></p><p data-lake-id="ude3b6eab" id="ude3b6eab"><span data-lake-id="ud6dd0ec6" id="ud6dd0ec6" class="lake-fontsize-11">​</span><br></p><h4 data-lake-id="XZ6M6" id="XZ6M6"><span data-lake-id="u1d898479" id="u1d898479">原子事务</span></h4><p data-lake-id="uf8809e16" id="uf8809e16"><span data-lake-id="u804eeab8" id="u804eeab8" class="lake-fontsize-11">具体见MainPipe。</span></p><p data-lake-id="u1ad2dd4f" id="u1ad2dd4f"><br></p><h4 data-lake-id="I38jS" id="I38jS"><span data-lake-id="u31f1b00a" id="u31f1b00a">Replay机制</span></h4><p data-lake-id="u3fcb793a" id="u3fcb793a"><span data-lake-id="u265672ca" id="u265672ca" class="lake-fontsize-11">Replay 只表示这一拍既没做完，也没被 MissQueue 接住。请求方稍后自己再发。LoadPipe 和 MainPipe 都不为了等入口停住。</span></p><p data-lake-id="ue24a4e18" id="ue24a4e18"><span data-lake-id="uf0fc9151" id="uf0fc9151" class="lake-fontsize-11">已经接住的不走这条。普通 load 拿着</span><span data-lake-id="ud7cd5a6a" id="ud7cd5a6a" class="lake-fontsize-11"> </span><code data-lake-id="u07c9997f" id="u07c9997f"><span data-lake-id="u805d0983" id="u805d0983" class="lake-fontsize-11">mshr_id</span></code><span data-lake-id="u344ca18b" id="u344ca18b" class="lake-fontsize-11"> </span><span data-lake-id="uf88c736c" id="uf88c736c" class="lake-fontsize-11">等</span><span data-lake-id="u1b336f15" id="u1b336f15" class="lake-fontsize-11"> </span><code data-lake-id="u70ecfa19" id="u70ecfa19"><span data-lake-id="u27218535" id="u27218535" class="lake-fontsize-11">forward_chi</span></code><span data-lake-id="u167319d9" id="u167319d9" class="lake-fontsize-11">、</span><code data-lake-id="ub2e3b318" id="ub2e3b318"><span data-lake-id="ude50f4a6" id="ude50f4a6" class="lake-fontsize-11">forward_mshr</span></code><span data-lake-id="u9551d690" id="u9551d690" class="lake-fontsize-11"> </span><span data-lake-id="u0f3ffca7" id="u0f3ffca7" class="lake-fontsize-11">或</span><span data-lake-id="ucdc07ec6" id="ucdc07ec6" class="lake-fontsize-11"> </span><code data-lake-id="u12a50483" id="u12a50483"><span data-lake-id="u6b0eba59" id="u6b0eba59" class="lake-fontsize-11">refill_wakeup</span></code><span data-lake-id="u94b15f7e" id="u94b15f7e" class="lake-fontsize-11">。store 等 refill 的 s3 拿成功。原子留在 AtomicsUnit，等 refill 做完再回答。</span></p><p data-lake-id="u7840f523" id="u7840f523"><span data-lake-id="u6c115a64" id="u6c115a64" class="lake-fontsize-11">没接住时各走各的：</span></p><table data-lake-id="xnvVq" id="xnvVq" margin="true" class="lake-table" style="width: 714px"><colgroup><col width="153"><col width="271"><col width="290"></colgroup><tbody><tr data-lake-id="u1ca048c7" id="u1ca048c7"><td data-lake-id="ue486d6fe" id="ue486d6fe"><p data-lake-id="u41d73286" id="u41d73286" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="u37d16a3d" id="u37d16a3d" class="lake-fontsize-11">请求</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="uc75642e8" id="uc75642e8"><p data-lake-id="u11811cb6" id="u11811cb6" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="ufcd3e9cd" id="ufcd3e9cd" class="lake-fontsize-11">什么时候 replay</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="ub0116190" id="ub0116190"><p data-lake-id="u8a5e8569" id="u8a5e8569" style="text-align: left"><span data-lake-id="u53aad7c6" id="u53aad7c6" class="lake-fontsize-11">谁重发</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="u245c917a" id="u245c917a"><td data-lake-id="ub9e18e23" id="ub9e18e23"><p data-lake-id="ue813a2ba" id="ue813a2ba"><span data-lake-id="u3ba2d417" id="u3ba2d417" class="lake-fontsize-11">普通 load</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u48750425" id="u48750425"><p data-lake-id="uc1341cd9" id="uc1341cd9"><span data-lake-id="ufcaf710d" id="ufcaf710d" class="lake-fontsize-11">这一拍 </span><code data-lake-id="u9c1f96b9" id="u9c1f96b9"><span data-lake-id="u69e0a565" id="u69e0a565" class="lake-fontsize-11">missReq</span></code><span data-lake-id="u0553c356" id="u0553c356" class="lake-fontsize-11">没被选中；MissQueue 拒绝；</span><code data-lake-id="ucae6383a" id="ucae6383a"><span data-lake-id="ueae16ada" id="ueae16ada" class="lake-fontsize-11">wbBlock=1</span></code><span data-lake-id="ud600e320" id="ud600e320" class="lake-fontsize-11">；bank 冲突</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="ud6289e6d" id="ud6289e6d"><p data-lake-id="u61d2c1d0" id="u61d2c1d0"><span data-lake-id="ucb3fd563" id="ucb3fd563" class="lake-fontsize-11">LoadUnit。还没做过 fast replay 的再走一遍 s0–s2，否则进 LoadQueue，以后再被选出来</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="ua8cb6d0d" id="ua8cb6d0d"><td data-lake-id="u03c56070" id="u03c56070"><p data-lake-id="u3f3df0d9" id="u3f3df0d9"><span data-lake-id="u3031f0c3" id="u3031f0c3" class="lake-fontsize-11">store</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u010cca58" id="u010cca58"><p data-lake-id="u263de88c" id="u263de88c"><span data-lake-id="u07c5e2e0" id="u07c5e2e0" class="lake-fontsize-11">同样没被 MissQueue 接接，或权限升级时 </span><code data-lake-id="u9c3c7006" id="u9c3c7006"><span data-lake-id="u75def654" id="u75def654" class="lake-fontsize-11">occupyFail=1</span></code></p></td><td data-lake-id="u3e643ffa" id="u3e643ffa"><p data-lake-id="u70800f33" id="u70800f33"><span data-lake-id="ua413799e" id="ua413799e" class="lake-fontsize-11">Sbuffer 等 16 拍再送 MainPipe</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="u0dc4673f" id="u0dc4673f"><td data-lake-id="u196c3922" id="u196c3922"><p data-lake-id="u6aaffd36" id="u6aaffd36"><span data-lake-id="uf28baeb9" id="uf28baeb9" class="lake-fontsize-11">原子</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u7c66f8c0" id="u7c66f8c0"><p data-lake-id="uc63b5932" id="uc63b5932"><span data-lake-id="ubf8a6df5" id="ubf8a6df5" class="lake-fontsize-11">没被MissQueue接收。</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="ub70eb59c" id="ub70eb59c"><p data-lake-id="u93f4a770" id="u93f4a770"><span data-lake-id="ud3a48fab" id="ud3a48fab" class="lake-fontsize-11">AtomicsUnit 回到</span><span data-lake-id="u51d27e16" id="u51d27e16" class="lake-fontsize-11"> </span><code data-lake-id="u889ee163" id="u889ee163"><span data-lake-id="u96e53dbc" id="u96e53dbc" class="lake-fontsize-11">s_cache_req</span></code></p><p data-lake-id="ub4383c45" id="ub4383c45"><span data-lake-id="ufa9d8b41" id="ufa9d8b41" class="lake-fontsize-11"> </span><span data-lake-id="u2ab8613e" id="u2ab8613e" class="lake-fontsize-11">再发，没有这 16 拍</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="u35ab09a9" id="u35ab09a9"><td data-lake-id="u80544fea" id="u80544fea"><p data-lake-id="u1c553681" id="u1c553681"><span data-lake-id="u6f743ee2" id="u6f743ee2" class="lake-fontsize-11">软件预取</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u5d7da721" id="u5d7da721"><p data-lake-id="u095c78c8" id="u095c78c8"><span data-lake-id="u5f2a3f79" id="u5f2a3f79" class="lake-fontsize-11">没被选中、被拒绝或</span><span data-lake-id="u97ec031d" id="u97ec031d" class="lake-fontsize-11"> </span><code data-lake-id="u308e65ac" id="u308e65ac"><span data-lake-id="uac7c1e75" id="uac7c1e75" class="lake-fontsize-11">wbBlock=1</span></code></p></td><td data-lake-id="u7c3bd4fe" id="u7c3bd4fe"><p data-lake-id="u69b1786b" id="u69b1786b"><span data-lake-id="ud72c6dd9" id="ud72c6dd9" class="lake-fontsize-11">不重发，直接丢掉</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p data-lake-id="u6d1f52c6" id="u6d1f52c6"><span data-lake-id="u43599b15" id="u43599b15" class="lake-fontsize-11">replay分</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ubaaa5892" id="ubaaa5892" class="lake-fontsize-11">快速replay</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u7e2ebb79" id="u7e2ebb79" class="lake-fontsize-11">和</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u6b0005f8" id="u6b0005f8" class="lake-fontsize-11">等待replay</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u0de84d0f" id="u0de84d0f" class="lake-fontsize-11">。</span></p><h4 data-lake-id="THZWA" id="THZWA"><span data-lake-id="u11a471ed" id="u11a471ed">虚拟别名</span></h4><p data-lake-id="u1453ed3b" id="u1453ed3b"><span data-lake-id="u5465acd3" id="u5465acd3">虚拟别名产生的本质是由于DCache是 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u271b4c43" id="u271b4c43">VIPT</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u346fb16b" id="u346fb16b"> 的同时</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ub65ecf99" id="ub65ecf99">容量比较大</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u9bb41949" id="u9bb41949">。</span></p><p data-lake-id="ub92a4cae" id="ub92a4cae"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F35409901%2F1793173575691-4327a637-bd2c-4641-88eb-6f19504458ca.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u79dc5e28-0ec9-42c4-8b9e-9d1960b2267%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u1e82e2e7-684f-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22%E8%99%9A%E6%8B%9F%E5%88%AB%E5%90%8D%E5%8E%9F%E5%9B%A0.drawio.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A12370%2C%22from%22%3A%22drop%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A483%2C%22originHeight%22%3A122%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E9%A1%B5%E5%86%85%E5%81%8F%E7%A7%BB%E5%A4%9A%5B11%3A0%5D%22%2C%22x%22%3A251%2C%22y%22%3A17%2C%22width%22%3A78%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22OFFSET%5B2%3A0%5D%22%2C%22x%22%3A393%2C%22y%22%3A83%2C%22width%22%3A54%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22BANKD2%3A0L%22%2C%22x%22%3A274%2C%22y%22%3A83%2C%22width%22%3A52%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22VPN%5B1%3A0%5D%22%2C%22x%22%3A35%2C%22y%22%3A7%2C%22width%22%3A50%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SET%5B1%3A0%5D%22%2C%22x%22%3A38%2C%22y%22%3A83%2C%22width%22%3A43%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SET5%3A0%5D%22%2C%22x%22%3A158%2C%22y%22%3A83%2C%22width%22%3A43%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f3f3f3%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u1a333e1f%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="uebc1bdf3" id="uebc1bdf3"><span data-lake-id="uc21b374e" id="uc21b374e">这里的高位set就是虚拟别名。这会导致什么结果呢？</span></p><p data-lake-id="u029d45cc" id="u029d45cc"><strong><span data-lake-id="uc5c3a3e4" id="uc5c3a3e4">​</span></strong><br></p><p data-lake-id="u2158ffab" id="u2158ffab"><strong><span data-lake-id="ue6c9d8cc" id="ue6c9d8cc">设想一种场景：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ueb7855b0" id="ueb7855b0"><br /></span><span data-lake-id="u46938702" id="u46938702">虚拟地址A和虚拟地址B都映射到了同一个物理地址X上。A的VPN是00，B的VPN是10。</span></p><p data-lake-id="u2944a063" id="u2944a063"><span data-lake-id="ucae2b757" id="ucae2b757">对A进行一次load，miss了之后会refill到set1中，后续B也进行一次load，miss了之后refill到set129中，此时storeA，就会产生物理地址X在A中有新值，物理地址X在B中有旧值，同时他们都是valid的。会发生取到旧值的情况。</span></p><p data-lake-id="u9807372a" id="u9807372a"><span data-lake-id="u37581726" id="u37581726">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id="u2df2b1cf" id="u2df2b1cf"><strong><span data-lake-id="u8d5c4be8" id="u8d5c4be8">处理方法：</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u9679b76a" id="u9679b76a"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F35409901%2F1793174069525-518968d5-9503-40c7-86cd-c09cbd8d036f.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u60518a77-9809-45a4-8d17-90498526016%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u1e82e2e7-684f-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A822.4%2C%22height%22%3A326%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22518218ccf7e88c6d2753a114a393e05c.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A86933%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1028%2C%22originHeight%22%3A407%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22.TXREQ%E5%B8%A6%E4%B8%8A%E4%BA%86TAGALIAS-01%E7%9A%84%E7%89%A9%E7%90%86%E5%9C%B0%E5%9D%80X%22%2C%22x%22%3A326%2C%22y%22%3A127%2C%22width%22%3A379%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%225.RXRSP%E5%B8%A6%E4%B8%8A%E4%BA%86TAGALIAS%3D00(OLD%E7%9A%84%E7%89%A9%E7%90%86%E5%9C%B0%E5%9D%80X%E6%97%A0%E6%95%88%E5%8C%96%22%2C%22x%22%3A284%2C%22y%22%3A265%2C%22width%22%3A513%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%221.TXREQ%E5%B8%A6%E4%B8%8A%E4%BA%86TAGALIAS-00%E7%9A%84%E7%89%A9%E7%90%86%E5%9C%B0%E5%9D%80X%22%2C%22x%22%3A326%2C%22y%22%3A60%2C%22width%22%3A379%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%222.%E7%9B%AE%E5%BD%95%E8%AE%B0%E5%BD%95%E4%B8%8B%E5%9C%B0%E5%9D%80X%E7%9A%84%22%2C%22x%22%3A789%2C%22y%22%3A89%2C%22width%22%3A207%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%226PROBEQUEUE%E7%94%A8%22%2C%22x%22%3A53%2C%22y%22%3A256%2C%22width%22%3A170%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2211%3A6%E7%9A%84%E5%88%B0%E6%AD%A3%E7%A1%AESET%2C%E5%B9%B6%22%2C%22x%22%3A40%2C%22y%22%3A305%2C%22width%22%3A203%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22L2CACHE%22%2C%22x%22%3A823%2C%22y%22%3A195%2C%22width%22%3A146%2C%22height%22%3A32%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%224%E7%9B%AE%E5%BD%95%E8%AE%B0%E5%BD%95%E5%8F%91%E7%8E%B0%E5%90%8C%E6%A0%B7%E5%9C%B0%22%2C%22x%22%3A783%2C%22y%22%3A266%2C%22width%22%3A217%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22DCACHE%22%2C%22x%22%3A76%2C%22y%22%3A194%2C%22width%22%3A131%2C%22height%22%3A32%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E4%B8%94%E8%AE%A9MAINPIPE%E6%97%A0%E6%95%88%E5%8C%96%22%2C%22x%22%3A45%2C%22y%22%3A330%2C%22width%22%3A196%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E4%B8%8D%E4%B8%80%E6%A0%B7%E7%9A%84TAGALIAS%22%2C%22x%22%3A806%2C%22y%22%3A318%2C%22width%22%3A172%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%9D%80X%E7%9A%84TXREQ%E8%AF%B7%E6%B1%82%E6%98%AF%22%2C%22x%22%3A792%2C%22y%22%3A291%2C%22width%22%3A204%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TAGALIAS%E5%92%8C%E5%9C%B0%E5%9D%80%E7%9A%84%22%2C%22x%22%3A51%2C%22y%22%3A281%2C%22width%22%3A174%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ALIAS%E6%98%AFO0%22%2C%22x%22%3A835%2C%22y%22%3A116%2C%22width%22%3A109%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23cb965e%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u0805c6f2%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u0c814e23" id="u0c814e23"><br></p><h4 data-lake-id="NZ4v9" id="NZ4v9"><span data-lake-id="u898dd995" id="u898dd995">CMO</span></h4><p data-lake-id="ue8b96b12" id="ue8b96b12"><span data-lake-id="ue3b9e1f3" id="ue3b9e1f3">全名cache management operation，内存管理操作。</span></p><p data-lake-id="ua2e0d836" id="ua2e0d836"><span data-lake-id="uc40937c5" id="uc40937c5">CMO走StroreBuffer通道，不进MainPipe，直接进到MissQueue中，只有本周起中没有其他MissEntry发起TXREQ，此时CMOUnit才可以发TXREQ。L2收到CMO的TXREQ后会查目录，只有目录里的状态不是CMO允许的最终状态时，才会发RXSNP，如果有脏需要返回，由MainPipe收到Probe后向WriteBackQueue发起Writebackreq来进行写回。</span></p><p data-lake-id="u974501ce" id="u974501ce"><span data-lake-id="ua5dfc3fd" id="ua5dfc3fd">​</span><br></p><h4 data-lake-id="KUP1z" id="KUP1z"><span data-lake-id="u2204f3ba" id="u2204f3ba">软件预取</span></h4><p data-lake-id="u14e7361e" id="u14e7361e"><span data-lake-id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-109-0" id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-109-0">软件预取在数据这一块只有</span><code data-lake-id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-109-1" id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-109-1"><span data-lake-id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-109-1-0" id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-109-1-0" class="lake-fontsize-11">prefetch.r</span></code><span data-lake-id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-109-2" id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-109-2" class="lake-fontsize-11">、</span><code data-lake-id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-109-3" id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-109-3"><span data-lake-id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-109-3-0" id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-109-3-0" class="lake-fontsize-11">prefetch.w</span></code><span data-lake-id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-109-4" id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-109-4" class="lake-fontsize-11">，由软件显式发出，进入 LoadUnit/LoadPipe，通过发送的cmd来区别正常load还是软件预取。</span></p><p data-lake-id="u40abcf44" id="u40abcf44"><span data-lake-id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-110-0" id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-110-0" class="lake-fontsize-11">软件预取的作用是软件提前给出一个地址和访问意图，处理器尝试将cacheline提前装入L1 DCache中，在真实访存稍后到来的时候可以减少miss延迟。</span></p><p data-lake-id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-111" id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-111"><span data-lake-id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-111-0" id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-111-0" class="lake-fontsize-11">prefetch.r表示预取read，提前把cacheline装入DCache，prefetch.w是表示预取write，除了吧cacheline装入DCache的操作，还会提升权限到UC/UD，减少后续store指令进来由于没有写权限导致的延迟。</span></p><p data-lake-id="u208231b2" id="u208231b2"><span data-lake-id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-113-0" id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-113-0" class="lake-fontsize-11">hit：预取想要的快刚好之前refill进来了且由对应的权限，此时预取不会进行读操作，进行空操作，预取结束。</span></p><p data-lake-id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-114" id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-114"><span data-lake-id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-114-0" id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-114-0" class="lake-fontsize-11">miss：软件预取通常会miss，走正常miss通道。在loadpipe的s1中判定miss了，在s2发miss_req是alloc或merge，那想要的cacheline数据后续会refill进来。如果被MSHR拒绝了，那就直接消失即可，毕竟是预取，消失了也对状态没影响，也不是真实load请求，没必要replay。</span></p><p data-lake-id="u4ab46232" id="u4ab46232"><span data-lake-id="ub6cc2817" id="ub6cc2817">​</span><br></p><h4 data-lake-id="XZ899" id="XZ899"><span data-lake-id="u8f0306c7" id="u8f0306c7">跨cacheline访存</span></h4><p data-lake-id="u7680d2c1" id="u7680d2c1"><span data-lake-id="u76f4fed5" id="u76f4fed5">DCache不能处理跨Cacheline的访存，需要上游拆分为两条请求。但DCache支持不跨Cacheline的非对齐访存，可以跨16B（不学香山跨16B得拆分）。</span></p><p data-lake-id="u7ab08b34" id="u7ab08b34"><span data-lake-id="uec84c51f" id="uec84c51f">​</span><br></p><h4 data-lake-id="GnSJB" id="GnSJB"><span data-lake-id="u91990310" id="u91990310">NC访存</span></h4><p data-lake-id="uf9316d6b" id="uf9316d6b"><span data-lake-id="u0cde89b7" id="u0cde89b7">DCache不负责NC访存，需要走另一个通道，由上游进行分辨内存属性之后走不同通道。</span></p><p data-lake-id="udd76d66f" id="udd76d66f"><span data-lake-id="u8c4e772d" id="u8c4e772d">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id="ua0fd7245" id="ua0fd7245"><span data-lake-id="ue7421fd2" id="ue7421fd2">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id="u0e8105e5" id="u0e8105e5"><span data-lake-id="u9463a520" id="u9463a520">​</span><br></p><h2 data-lake-id="kbNIW" id="kbNIW"><span data-lake-id="ub6380454" id="ub6380454">存储组织与数据结构</span></h2><h4 data-lake-id="MOKn7" id="MOKn7"><span data-lake-id="u1cf8d495" id="u1cf8d495">DataArray</span></h4><p data-lake-id="u5ee813b5" id="u5ee813b5"><span data-lake-id="u6d951454" id="u6d951454">由sram实现</span></p><p data-lake-id="ue8a84ba1" id="ue8a84ba1"><span data-lake-id="ucffbc16e" id="ucffbc16e">分256set，8bank，4way，一个bank 64bit。DataArray中会例化出32个SRAM宏</span></p><p data-lake-id="ua829341c" id="ua829341c"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F35409901%2F1793171891039-77840c45-3091-4135-b9ad-fde87499e718.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u33139dcb-5828-46ea-96ce-3b995ac3ed3%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u1e82e2e7-684f-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22%E5%B8%A6wpu%E7%9A%84bank%E7%BB%84%E7%BB%87%E5%BD%A2%E5%BC%8F.drawio.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A129211%2C%22from%22%3A%22drop%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A702%2C%22originHeight%22%3A433%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22256SET%2C4WAY%2C8BANK%E7%9A%84DATABANK%E7%BB%84%E7%BB%87%E5%BD%A2%E5%BC%8F%22%2C%22x%22%3A157%2C%22y%22%3A0%2C%22width%22%3A393%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E9%80%89SET%E4%B9%8B%E5%90%8E%E6%A0%B9%E6%8D%AEWPU%E9%A2%84%E6%B5%8B%E7%9A%84WAY%E5%8E%BB%E8%AF%BB%E5%85%B6%22%2C%22x%22%3A203%2C%22y%22%3A284%2C%22width%22%3A322%2C%22height%22%3A21%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E4%B8%AD%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AAWAY%E4%B8%AD%E7%9A%84%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%22%2C%22x%22%3A265%2C%22y%22%3A309%2C%22width%22%3A200%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22OFFSET2OFFSET3%22%2C%22x%22%3A278%2C%22y%22%3A255%2C%22width%22%3A107%2C%22height%22%3A11%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%B8%A6WPU%22%2C%22x%22%3A48%2C%22y%22%3A43%2C%22width%22%3A41%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22FSET5%22%2C%22x%22%3A453%2C%22y%22%3A374%2C%22width%22%3A39%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22FFSET4%22%2C%22x%22%3A399%2C%22y%22%3A115%2C%22width%22%3A40%2C%22height%22%3A11%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22FISET5%22%2C%22x%22%3A448%2C%22y%22%3A115%2C%22width%22%3A36%2C%22height%22%3A11%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22BANK1BANK2%22%2C%22x%22%3A244%2C%22y%22%3A55%2C%22width%22%3A94%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22FFSET4%22%2C%22x%22%3A403%2C%22y%22%3A374%2C%22width%22%3A39%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22OFFSET6%22%2C%22x%22%3A495%2C%22y%22%3A216%2C%22width%22%3A36%2C%22height%22%3A11%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22OFFSET2%22%2C%22x%22%3A295%2C%22y%22%3A374%2C%22width%22%3A44%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22OFSET7%22%2C%22x%22%3A547%2C%22y%22%3A374%2C%22width%22%3A42%2C%22height%22%3A11%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22OFFSET5%22%2C%22x%22%3A446%2C%22y%22%3A155%2C%22width%22%3A42%2C%22height%22%3A11%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22FFSET3%22%2C%22x%22%3A348%2C%22y%22%3A115%2C%22width%22%3A38%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22OFFSET6%22%2C%22x%22%3A494%2C%22y%22%3A155%2C%22width%22%3A39%2C%22height%22%3A11%7D%2C%7