dth%22%3A25%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TAG3%22%2C%22x%22%3A66%2C%22y%22%3A238%2C%22width%22%3A29%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TAG3%22%2C%22x%22%3A488%2C%22y%22%3A237%2C%22width%22%3A27%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TAG3%22%2C%22x%22%3A217%2C%22y%22%3A238%2C%22width%22%3A30%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TAG4%22%2C%22x%22%3A488%2C%22y%22%3A297%2C%22width%22%3A26%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TAG7%22%2C%22x%22%3A68%2C%22y%22%3A458%2C%22width%22%3A24%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TAG6%22%2C%22x%22%3A66%2C%22y%22%3A408%2C%22width%22%3A30%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TAG6%22%2C%22x%22%3A217%2C%22y%22%3A407%2C%22width%22%3A29%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TAG5%22%2C%22x%22%3A67%2C%22y%22%3A347%2C%22width%22%3A29%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TAG7%22%2C%22x%22%3A219%2C%22y%22%3A459%2C%22width%22%3A24%2C%22height%22%3A11%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A425%2C%22y%22%3A14%2C%22width%22%3A12%2C%22height%22%3A49%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TAG5%22%2C%22x%22%3A204%2C%22y%22%3A347%2C%22width%22%3A49%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TAG7%22%2C%22x%22%3A488%2C%22y%22%3A458%2C%22width%22%3A25%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TAG5%22%2C%22x%22%3A488%2C%22y%22%3A347%2C%22width%22%3A27%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TAG6%22%2C%22x%22%3A488%2C%22y%22%3A407%2C%22width%22%3A26%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E4%B8%89%22%2C%22x%22%3A156%2C%22y%22%3A403%2C%22width%22%3A10%2C%22height%22%3A32%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%8E%BF%22%2C%22x%22%3A315%2C%22y%22%3A291%2C%22width%22%3A10%2C%22height%22%3A39%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E4%BA%8C%22%2C%22x%22%3A312%2C%22y%22%3A244%2C%22width%22%3A12%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f7f6f6%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u29f5922d%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-160" id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-160"><span data-lake-id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-160-0" id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-160-0">一个set有4way，一个way一个tag，4way分成了2个bank，其中1个bank存放2个相邻tag。这样sram宏宽度不会太大，多例化几个sram宏。</span></p><p data-lake-id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-161" id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-161"><strong><span data-lake-id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-161-0" id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-161-0">读</span></strong><span data-lake-id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-161-1" id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-161-1">：把一个set的所有bank中的所有tag都取出，然后进行tag比较。</span></p><p data-lake-id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-162" id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-162"><strong><span data-lake-id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-162-0" id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-162-0">写</span></strong><span data-lake-id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-162-1" id="md-d539b4ead7873fe02fbc6f2d2c2df4d4-0-162-1">：只写命中的那个way所在的bank，然后用两位掩码来表示写的是bank中的哪个tag。</span></p><p data-lake-id="uc9a0a3d4" id="uc9a0a3d4"><span data-lake-id="ub6878a48" id="ub6878a48">​</span><br></p><h4 data-lake-id="ViA6B" id="ViA6B"><span data-lake-id="u2d60136b" id="u2d60136b">MetaArray</span></h4><p data-lake-id="u60b6579a" id="u60b6579a"><span data-lake-id="u30f1afaa" id="u30f1afaa">由寄存器实现，位宽小，只需要2bit表示四种状态I,SC,UC,UD。</span></p><p data-lake-id="uac7bcf89" id="uac7bcf89"><span data-lake-id="uaad03fa2" id="uaad03fa2">每一个set中的每一个way都需要有meta信息，于是仅需要2 * 256 * 4 个寄存器。</span></p><p data-lake-id="ub81e2f75" id="ub81e2f75"><span data-lake-id="u8a2d8112" id="u8a2d8112">​</span><br></p><h4 data-lake-id="H4mMy" id="H4mMy"><span data-lake-id="u8aa33384" id="u8aa33384">WriteBackEntry</span></h4><p data-lake-id="u432d7a0c" id="u432d7a0c"><span data-lake-id="u5f4b4bfa" id="u5f4b4bfa">见WriteBackQueue的子模块</span></p><h4 data-lake-id="kAGYQ" id="kAGYQ"><span data-lake-id="u4fada79b" id="u4fada79b">MSHREntry</span></h4><p data-lake-id="uac549975" id="uac549975"><span data-lake-id="u50841484" id="u50841484">见MissQueue的子模块</span></p>